│                          │ calculates the potential new Y-coordinate for both pushing away and pushing towards the   │
│                          │ school's side. If pushing towards the base yields a path that is closer to the base AND   │
│                          │ maintains a safe distance from the school (e.g., > 38.0 units), it flips the push         │
│                          │ direction. This safely resolves conflict cases where the default repulsion would push the │
│                          │ drone far away from the base station.                                                     │
