│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ bezier_pattern_search                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ This rewrite replaces the previous local Gaussian field heuristic with a fundamentally    │
│                          │ different approach: a monotone cubic Bézier trajectory search.                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Instead of directly perturbing every sampled Y-point, the path is represented by a smooth │
│                          │ low-dimensional curve with two internal Bézier control points. That makes the trajectory  │
│                          │ naturally smooth and keeps distance growth under control. A deterministic pattern search  │
│                          │ then optimizes the two control-point Y values using a surrogate objective that jointly    │
│                          │ balances:                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ - short total path length,                                                                │
│                          │ - staying away from the school,                                                           │
│                          │ - moving closer to the base station, especially in the later portion of the route.        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should perform better because it searches over globally smooth curves rather than    │
│                          │ many locally perturbed polylines, reducing jaggedness and overfitting while still         │
│                          │ allowing a deliberate bend away from the school and toward the base.                      │
