│ patch_description        │ Upgrade base attraction to be conflict-aware. Instead of adding independent offsets for   │
│                          │ school and base, we first apply the school repulsion to the baseline, and then apply a    │
│                          │ proportional pull towards the base station from the *current* displaced position. To      │
│                          │ prevent the base attraction from pulling the drone back into the school's noise zone, we  │
│                          │ modulate the base pull strength inversely with the school's influence (`w_school`). We    │
│                          │ also increase the base pull rate and school repulsion amplitude to better match the       │
│                          │ successful dynamic programming approach's prioritization of F2 and F3.                    │
